a1: the original sentence is kept
a2: an empty metadata prefix is reported as empty
f: the listing attempts and the time they spanned are reported
b1: an entry the suffix filter dropped is named
b2: its modification time is reported
c1: a long listing keeps its total and counts the remainder
c2: entry names printed: 10
d: retry log lines: 4
e: listing traces: 5
g: the raw and the filtered listing counts are both logged
h: a candidate rejected as a temporary commit file is reported
h2: candidates are reported when table UUID selection finds none
